SUMMARY:Holiday New York City Hike!
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for our annual Holiday New York City Hike!\nThis year\, we'll meet
  at New York Penn Station\, in the mall type area with the large Christmas
  tree like we usually do (it's in the cover photo here).\nThis would be th
 e big circular area in NY Penn Station.\nFrom there\, we'll all take the s
 ubway north to Van Cortland Park\, Bronx\, and we'll start with a bunch of
  the trails there we've never done before.\nFrom there\, we head west towa
 rd the Hudson River where we'll begin heading south on some of the trails 
 and walkways.\nWe'll walk the newly reopened pedestrian lanes over Henry H
 udson Bridge and then follow slopes though Inwood Hills Park and Fort Tryo
 n Park.\nAfter this\, we'll try to take the Hudson River Greenway and Empi
 re State Trail\, but keep to the more middle section of it. We've done the
  upper and lower bits in the past\, so this is an opportunity to do some o
 f the other middle ground.\nWe're planning on doing about fifteen miles\, 
 but in the city\, people can cut out just about any time with all of the p
 ublic transportation.\nIf needed\, contact me at 908 343 8374\nNOTE that w
 hen you arrive\, use the restroom right away. Every year\, we end up waiti
 ng around\, and then after waiting around and we're about ready to go\, ev
 eryone decides they want to use the restroom. Don't do that!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/metrotrails/events/317480209/
